</div>", "+      <div class="metric-desc">Reconstructed in the connectome dataset</div>", "     </div>", "     <div class="metric-card">", "       <div class="metric-value">~54M</div>", "       <div class="metric-label">Synaptic Connections</div>", "-      <div class="metric-desc">Individual synapses identified and catalogued</div>", "+      <div class="metric-desc">Individual synapses identified &amp; catalogued</div>", "     </div>", "     <div class="metric-card">", "       <div class="metric-value">37</div>", "       <div class="metric-label">Circuit Motifs</div>", "-      <div class="metric-desc">Distinct recurring connectivity motifs discovered</div>", "+      <div class="metric-desc">Distinct recurring connectivity motifs</div>", "     </div>", "     <div class="metric-card">", "       <div class="metric-value">94.2%</div>", "       <div class="metric-label">Classification Accuracy</div>", "-      <div class="metric-desc">Automated neuron-type classification performance</div>", "+      <div class="metric-desc">Automated neuron-type classification</div>", "     </div>", "+    <div class="metric-card">", "+      <div class="metric-value">2024</div>", "+      <div class="metric-label">Nature Publication</div>", "+      <div class="metric-desc">s41586-024-07487-w</div>", "+    </div>", "   </div>", " ", "   <!-- ════════ BACKGROUND ════════ -->", "-  <div class="section background-section">", "+  <div class="section">", "     <div class="section-label blue">Background</div>", "     <div class="section-title">Background &amp; Motivation</div>", "     <div class="section-text">", "-      Understanding how the brain processes information requires detailed maps of neural connectivity. While classical neuroanatomy provided foundational insights, the field has long lacked the resolution and scale needed to capture complete circuit-level wiring diagrams. This study represents a landmark effort to reconstruct and analyze neural circuits at unprecedented scale.", "+      